        <p>Freedom Fellowship. Guy Bowman will address the open Freedom Fellowship meeting on Monday.</p>
        <p>Lymm Liberal Association. The annual social and dance'will be held in the Lyinni Drill Hall on Wednesday, Feb. 11th.</p>
        <p>Life and Death.</p>
        <p>There were 44 births in Warrington last week, giving a rate of 31.5. The deaths numbered 31, giving a rate of 21.7.</p>
        <p>Scarlet Fever Increasing. Nine now eases of scarlet fever were notified last week. There are 62 cases in hospital, thc highest total for some time.</p>
