      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-01-31_WidnesExaminer_art0100" n="art0100">
        <head>Ii -__ f .. – ; DISTRICT /JEWS E' 1 . 0,.__..0.1.</head>
        <p>Ii -__ f .. - ; DISTRICT /JEWS E' 1 . 0,.__..0.1.</p>
        <p>i e.. '.,1,., i , ',.• ~ '„,,.. , 4 , 4 f ~ tl</p>
        <p>TOWNSHIP TIME-TATTLE.</p>
        <p>,</p>
        <p>04-r</p>
        <p>Soci</p>
        <p>1 ' . 4t .:.1 -i Ni. i 4 A; $,..4</p>
